<title>USA: Viacom Inc unit names new exec vice pres.</title>
<headline>Viacom Inc unit names new exec vice pres.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video rental and music store operator Blockbuster said on Wednesday that it had named Jim Notarnicola as executive vice president of marketing and administration.</p>
<p>Notarnicola has 18 years experience in retailing and previously worked at Southland Corp, Blockbuster said in a statement.</p>
<p>Blockbuster, a division of Viacom Inc, operates nearly 6,000 video and music stores.</p>
